---
description: Prepare one trackAcknowledgment evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: PreparationQuestion[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Record receipt, acknowledgment, and reported completion distinctly, respecting contact preferences and quiet periods. Escalate unresolved administrative barriers under supplied procedures without assuming acknowledgment proves comprehension or medical readiness. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
